<section class="desk" aria-labelledby="who">
 <div class="desk-layout">
  <div>
  <h1 id="who">{{ site.name }}</h1>
  <p class="role">{{ site.role }}</p>

  <div class="statement">
    <p>I reverse-engineer things until I find the assumption that was never questioned. Professionally, that means security research. Outside that, it means building systems from scratch to understand why they work, not just that they do.</p>
    <p>I founded FPS Zero (First Principle Synthesis) as a framework for exactly that: approaching problems in cybersecurity, quantum systems, and cognitive science without borrowing conclusions from adjacent fields prematurely. The goal is to find where the map of one domain becomes the map of all the others.</p>
    <p>The esoteric interests are not decoration. Consciousness, information theory, and adversarial systems are asking the same questions from different angles. I take that seriously.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="now">
    <p class="caps">At the desk</p>
    <p>To hear the symphony of the universe and play it back</p>
  </div>

